 Villa Guerrero."},{"name":"The state of Colima","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["the city of Manzanillo by sea, or by air via Manzanillo-Costalegre International Airport","direct travel via road 200 from that airport to Manzanillo"]},{"name":"The state of Guerrero, including the city of Acapulco","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["the town of Zihuatanejo/Ixtapa accessed by air"]},{"name":"Within 40km of the Guatemalan border, from the Pacific Coast up to and including the Gracias a Dios crossing","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential"},{"name":"Federal Highway 199 between Rancho Nuevo, outside San Cristóbal de las Casas, and the Chancalá junction outside Palenque","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","note":"The restriction is the highway segment, not the towns at either end."}],"fcdo_zones_provenance":{"file":"src/data/safety.json","ref":"f8666636bc25790e0c9643ad5656f8d9fea37bf6","ref_committed":"2026-08-30T05:44:55Z","country_iso2":"MX","summary":"The FCDO advises against all but essential travel to named states, cities and border areas of Mexico — listed below in its own words, each with its own exceptions. The Yucatán Peninsula, Mexico City, Baja California Sur and the other main visitor regions carry no FCDO restriction.","source":"UK FCDO — Mexico travel advice, reviewed 2026-07-16 (verbatim snapshot from the research library)","_rule":"the FCDO restricted-area records for this country, verbatim. PRESENCE OF THIS BLOCK IS NOT A CLAIM THAT THIS DESTINATION SITS IN ANY OF THEM — membership is a coverage judgement and is set only in `zone_record`, by a human."}},"timing":{"peak":"Dec-Apr (dry season; highest rates, biggest crowds)","shoulder":"May-Jun & Nov (~30-40% off, good weather)","green":"Jun-mid-Oct (hurricane/low; cheapest)","sargassum_window":"Apr-Aug (Jun-Jul peak); Playa moderate risk with barrier program","fill_the_beds":"green/sargassum months pivot to cenote dives, Cozumel reef, Xcaret/Xplor parks, Fifth Avenue food+nightlife","fire_date":"peak campaigns open Aug-Sep; shoulder ~3-4 months out","event_peaks":["Christmas/New Year","Spring Break (Mar)","Semana Santa"],"booking_lead":"peak 3-4 months; shoulder 4-6 months"},"jewels":[{"name":"Cozumel reef wall (Palancar/Santa Rosa/Columbia)","si_tag":"Dive Globally","status":"future","tier":"comfort","hook":"World-class drift-wall diving on the Mesoamerican Reef, 40 min by ferry.","bookable_category":"dive excursion / liveaboard","source":"https://www.viator.com/Playa-del-Carmen/Cozumel/day-trips-d5501-d632","timing":"Dec-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"World-class drift-wall diving on the Mesoamerican Reef, 40 min by ferry.","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"Amstar excursion 12% or dive-operator affiliate","wells":["move","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"destination","diveglobal":"primary","expedition":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":12,"commission_pct_high":12,"commission_lane":["operator","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Cenote cavern dive — Chikin-Ha / Dos Ojos","si_tag":"Dive Globally","status":"future","tier":"comfort","hook":"Guided cavern dives with light beams and stalactites in the world''s longest cave system.","bookable_category":"cenote cavern dive (guide required)","source":"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g150812-Activities-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html","timing":"Dec-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"Guided cavern dives with light beams and stalactites in the world''s longest cave system.","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"DMC excursion 12% / affiliate 4-8%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"destination","diveglobal":"primary","expedition":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":4,"commission_pct_high":8,"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Xplor zipline + underground river","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","tier":"essential","hook":"Mexico''s largest zipline circuit — 14 lines over 3.8 km plus amphibious buggies.","bookable_category":"eco-park adventure","source":"https://blog.xcaret.com/en/welcome-to-playa-del-carmen-mexico/","timing":"Dec-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"expedition","blurb":"Mexico''s largest zipline circuit — 14 lines over 3.8 km plus amphibious buggies.","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"Xcaret Agents / affiliate; park entry pass-through","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"destination","diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"primary","romance":"destination"},"commission_lane":["affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Cobá + Tulum ruins day loop","si_tag":"Culture & Heritage","status":"future","tier":"essential","hook":"Cliff-top Tulum plus bikeable jungle pyramids at Cobá in one Maya day.","bookable_category":"guided cultural excursion","source":"https://www.amstardmc.com/en/destinations/mexico/tulum/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","blurb":"Cliff-top Tulum plus bikeable jungle pyramids at Cobá in one Maya day.","when":"year-round","commission":"Amstar 12%; ruin entry pass-through","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"primary","diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":12,"commission_pct_high":12,"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band"},{"name":"La Casa de la Playa (Grupo Xcaret)","si_tag":"Romance & Honeymoons","status":"live","tier":"ultra","hook":"AAA Five-Diamond luxury on the Xcaret estate with private park access.","bookable_category":"luxury all-inclusive resort","source":"https://www.travelagentcentral.com/your-business/grupo-xcaret-launches-xcaret-agents-pro-booking-tool","timing":"Dec-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"romance","blurb":"AAA Five-Diamond luxury on the Xcaret estate with private park access.","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"Xcaret Agents Pro — 15% auto-paid at check-out","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["romance"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"destination","diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"destination","romance":"primary"},"commission_pct_low":15,"commission_pct_high":15,"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Playa del Carmen?","a":"Sargassum, weather and water — not violent crime against tourists. 2026 is a record-forecast sargassum year, but Playa is moderate risk thanks to active municipal cleanup and a 5-km double-barrier program, with landings in pulses. Drink bottled water, use repellent for dengue (peak May–Nov, no malaria), and note hurricane season runs June–November.","source":"deeparrival.com / cdc.gov, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Can I dive Cozumel and the cenotes from Playa del Carmen?","a":"Yes — Playa is the best mainland dive base for both. Cozumel''s drift-wall reef (Palancar, Santa Rosa, Columbia) is a 40-minute ferry away at ~US$32 round trip, and cenote cavern dives sit under 30 minutes inland. Cozumel walls are drift dives for a reputable operator; cenotes are guide-required and weather-independent.","source":"viator.com / tripadvisor.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"What is there to do on Fifth Avenue?","a":"Fifth Avenue (Quinta Avenida) is the Riviera Maya''s densest dining and nightlife strip — a multi-kilometre pedestrian street of tacos-to-rooftop bars parallel to the sand. It is the town''s social spine, best on a weekday evening before the crowds; guided food-and-rooftop crawls are the easy way to graze it.","source":"tripadvisor.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"entertainment","si_fold_note":"folded from the retired `nightlife` slug into Global Live Entertainment 2026-08-23; the content is kept, the retired slug is not"},{"q":"Are the Xcaret and Xplor parks worth it, especially for families?","a":"Yes — they are the region''s marquee eco-parks. Xcaret runs cenotes, underground rivers and Maya performances; Xplor has Mexico''s largest zipline circuit (14 lines over 3.8 km) plus amphibious buggies. Park admission (~US$85–110 at Xcaret) is pass-through, and both sit just outside town — a full family day out.","source":"blog.xcaret.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Can I visit Maya ruins from Playa del Carmen?","a":"Yes — it is the corridor''s best ruins base. Tulum''s cliff-top ruins and Cobá''s bikeable jungle pyramids pair in one day loop, and Chichén Itzá is a longer day trip; early morning (Nov/Feb) is best. Amstar and other DMCs run guided excursions, with ruin entry as a pass-through cost.","source":"amstardmc.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"Where''s the best luxury for a honeymoon near Playa del Carmen?","a":"The Mayakoba estate and La Casa de la Playa. Mayakoba (Rosewood, Banyan Tree, Andaz) is a gated 595-acre lagoon estate of Virtuoso-affiliated flagships; La Casa de la Playa (Grupo Xcaret) is a 63-suite AAA Five-Diamond boutique ranked #1 Resort in Mexico for 2025. Both are ultra-tier honeymoon addresses on Playa''s doorstep.","source":"jetsetchristina.com / virtuoso.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit Playa del Carmen?","a":"November–March is the dry, cooler high season (best weather, highest rates); May–October is hot, humid and rainy at the cheapest rates. The value sweet spots are the May–June and November shoulders at ~30–40% off, with November landing clear of sargassum and ahead of the holiday surge.","source":"machupicchu.org / travelswithelle.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"planning"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Playa del Carmen Travel Guide 2026 — Cenotes, Cozumel Diving & Fifth Avenue | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan Playa del Carmen: cenote diving, the 40-minute Cozumel reef ferry, Fifth Avenue nightlife, Xcaret parks, plus straight 2026 sargassum, safety and dive-chamber info.","slug":"playa-del-carmen-mexico","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04","search_language":["en","es-MX"],"local_keywords":["qué hacer en Playa del Carmen","cenotes cerca de Playa del Carmen","ferry a Cozumel desde Playa del Carmen","mejor época para visitar Playa del Carmen 2026","sargazo Playa del Carmen 2026","buceo en cenotes Playa del Carmen","Quinta Avenida Playa del Carmen"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-04","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-20T14:49:02Z","source_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"romance","status":"live"},{"si":"expedition","status":"live"},{"si":"diveglobal","status":"future"},{"si":"culture","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Rosewood Mayakoba","price_tier":"ultra","virtuoso":true,"earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso","mor_posture":true,"source":"https://www.jetsetchristina.com/w